#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:26
msgid "Introduction to LXDM"
msgstr "Introdução ao <quote>LXDM</quote>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:29
msgid ""
"The <application>LXDM</application> is a lightweight Display Manager for the"
" <application>LXDE</application> desktop. It can also be used as an "
"alternative to other Display Managers such as "
"<application>GNOME's</application> <application>GDM</application> or "
"<application>LightDM</application>."
msgstr ""
"O &quot;<application>LXDM</application>&quot; é um Gerenciador de Tela leve "
"para a área de trabalho do &quot;<application>LXDE</application>&quot;. Ele "
"também pode ser usado como uma alternativa a outros Gerenciadores de Tela "
"como o &quot;<application>GDM</application>&quot; do "
"&quot;<application>GNOME</application>&quot; ou o "
"&quot;<application>LightDM</application>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:40
msgid ""
"The <application>lxdm</application> display manager does not support wayland"
" based window managers such as <application>plasma-wayland</application> or "
"<application>gnome-wayland</application>."
msgstr ""
"O gerenciador de tela &quot;<application>lxdm</application>&quot; não "
"suporta gerenciadores de janela baseados em &quot;wayland&quot;, como o "
"&quot;<application>plasma-wayland</application>&quot; ou "
"&quot;<application>gnome-wayland</application>&quot;."

