#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:161
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:164
#, no-wrap
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:170
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações dos Comandos"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:173
msgid ""
"<command>cat &gt; pam/lxdm &lt;&lt; \"EOF\" ...</command>: Replace default "
"<filename>/etc/pam.d/lxdm</filename> by another one appropriate for BLFS."
msgstr ""
"<command>cat &gt; pam/lxdm &lt;&lt; \"EOF\" ...</command>: Substitua o "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/pam.d/lxdm</filename>&quot; padrão por outro apropriado"
" para o BLFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:178
msgid ""
"<command>sed -i ... data/lxdm.conf.in</command>: Modifications in the "
"default configuration: (1) fix the background to the default one; (2) "
"restart X when session is close; (3) typo; and (4) include "
"<envar>XORG_PREFIX</envar>, which may be different from <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<command>sed -i ... data/lxdm.conf.in</command>: Modificações na "
"configuração padrão: (1) corrigir o plano de fundo para o padrão; (2) "
"reiniciar o &quot;X&quot; quando a sessão for fechada; (3) erro de "
"digitação; e (4) incluir &quot;<envar>XORG_PREFIX</envar>&quot;, que pode "
"ser diferente de &quot;<filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:188
msgid ""
"<command>sed -i ... data/Xsession</command>: Source "
"<filename>/etc/profile</filename>, instead of other file, according to BLFS "
"standard."
msgstr ""
"<command>sed -i ... data/Xsession</command>: Carregar "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/profile</filename>&quot;, em vez de outro arquivo, de "
"acordo com o padrão do BLFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:194
msgid ""
"<command>sed -i ... data/lxdm.in</command>: Fix greeter's locale for BLFS "
"specification."
msgstr ""
"<command>sed -i ... data/lxdm.in</command>: Corrija a localidade do saudador"
" para especificação do BLFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:199
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-pam</parameter>: This parameter enables use of pam "
"authentication."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-pam</parameter>: Esse parâmetro habilita o uso da "
"autenticação &quot;PAM&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:204
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-systemdsystemunitdir=no</parameter>: BLFS does not support"
" systemd."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-systemdsystemunitdir=no</parameter>: o BLFS não suporta o "
"&quot;systemd&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:211
msgid "Configuring LXDM"
msgstr "Configurando o <quote>LXDM</quote>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:214
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:217
msgid "<filename>/etc/lxdm/lxdm.conf</filename>"
msgstr "<filename>/etc/lxdm/lxdm.conf</filename>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:221
msgid "/etc/lxdm/lxdm.conf"
msgstr "/etc/lxdm/lxdm.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:227
msgid ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\">Boot Script</phrase> <phrase "
"revision=\"systemd\">Systemd Unit</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\">Conjunto de Comandos Sequenciais de "
"Inicialização</phrase> <phrase revision=\"systemd\">Unidade do "
"systemd</phrase>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:235
msgid ""
"To start <command>lxdm</command> automatically when the system is switched "
"to runlevel 5, install the <filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/xdm</filename> script "
"and the <filename>/etc/sysconfig/xdm</filename> configuration file included "
"in the <xref linkend=\"bootscripts\"/> package and adjust "
"<filename>/etc/inittab</filename> by running as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar o &quot;<command>lxdm</command>&quot; automaticamente quando o "
"sistema for comutado para o nível de execução 5, instale o conjunto de "
"comandos sequenciais &quot;<filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/xdm</filename>&quot; e"
" o arquivo de configuração "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/sysconfig/xdm</filename>&quot; incluído no pacote "
"&quot;<xref linkend=\"bootscripts\"/>&quot; e ajuste o "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/inittab</filename>&quot; executando como o(a) "
"usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:244
#, no-wrap
msgid "<userinput>make install-lxdm</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-lxdm</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:247
msgid ""
"To start <application>LXDM</application> at boot execute the following "
"command as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar o &quot;<application>LXDM</application>&quot; na inicialização,"
" execute o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:251
#, no-wrap
msgid "<userinput>systemctl enable lxdm</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>systemctl enable lxdm</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:256
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:259
msgid ""
"The LXDM daemon configuration file "
"(<filename>/etc/lxdm/lxdm.conf</filename>) specifies options that include "
"numlock on/off, background image (bg), session, etc.  You can set a default "
"session by uncommenting the line: session=/usr/bin/startlxde and replacing "
"<command>startlxde</command> with your session of choice. For "
"<application>GNOME</application> session=/usr/bin/gnome-session.  For "
"<application>OPENBOX</application> session=/usr/bin/openbox-session and for "
"<application>XFCE</application> session=/usr/bin/startxfce4."
msgstr ""
"O arquivo de configuração do processo de segundo plano do &quot;LXDM&quot; "
"(&quot;<filename>/etc/lxdm/lxdm.conf</filename>&quot;) especifica opções que"
" incluem &quot;numlock&quot; &quot;on&quot;/&quot;off&quot;, imagem de plano"
" de fundo (&quot;bg&quot;), sessão, etc. Você consegue configurar uma sessão"
" padrão descomentando a linha: &quot;session=/usr/bin/startlxde&quot; e "
"substituindo &quot;<command>startlxde</command>&quot; pela sessão da tua "
"escolha. Para o &quot;<application>GNOME</application>&quot;, "
"&quot;session=/usr/bin/gnome-session&quot;. Para o "
"&quot;<application>OPENBOX</application>&quot;, "
"&quot;session=/usr/bin/openbox-session&quot; e para o "
"&quot;<application>XFCE</application>&quot;, "
"&quot;session=/usr/bin/startxfce4&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:273
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<literal>[Desktop]\n"
"        Session=xfce</literal>"
msgstr ""
"<literal>[Desktop]\n"
"         Session=xfce</literal>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:271
msgid ""
"It is also possible to set the preferred session on a per-user basis by "
"editing the ~/.dmrc file for each user and adding: <placeholder "
"type=\"screen\" id=\"0\"/>"
msgstr ""
"Também é possível configurar a sessão preferida por usuário(a) editando o "
"arquivo &quot;~/.dmrc&quot; para cada usuário(a) e adicionando: <placeholder"
" type=\"screen\" id=\"0\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:278
msgid ""
"You can replace the default dummy face in the greeting screen by another "
"image representing your user. For that, copy or symlink the desired image to"
" your home directory with the name <filename>.face</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Você pode substituir o rosto fictício padrão na tela de saudação por outra "
"imagem representando teu(ua) usuário(a). Para isso, copie ou simbolicamente "
"vincule a imagem desejada para o teu diretório inicial com o nome "
"&quot;<filename>.face</filename>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:286
msgid "Starting lxdm"
msgstr "Iniciando o <quote>lxdm</quote>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:289
msgid ""
"The <command>lxdm</command> greeter can be started from the command line as "
"the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"O saudador &quot;<command>lxdm</command>&quot; pode ser iniciado a partir da"
" linha de comando como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:293
#, no-wrap
msgid "<userinput>telinit 5</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>telinit 5</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:296
msgid ""
"Alternatively the runlevel can be permanently set to 5, starting the "
"<command>lxdm</command> greeter screen automatically, by modifying "
"<filename>/etc/inittab</filename>. As the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Alternativamente, o nível de execução pode ser permanentemente configurado "
"como 5, iniciando a tela de boas-vindas do "
"&quot;<command>lxdm</command>&quot; automaticamente, modificando-se o "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/inittab</filename>&quot;. Como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lxdm.xml:302
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<userinput>cp -v /etc/inittab{,-orig} &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed -i '/initdefault/ s/3/5/' /etc/inittab</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cp -v /etc/inittab{,-orig} &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed -i '/initdefault/ s/3/5/' /etc/inittab</userinput>"

